      "expect": "deny",
      "rule": "all",
      "expect_by_judge": {
        "pi": "deny"
      },
      "why": "pi does not judge `models: all` rules, but an UNBALANCED QUOTE makes the command unparseable, and every judge then treats it as reaching every protected path (the remote `no-read` rules included). pi blocking is the fail-closed rule, not a divergence."
